Laya Multilingual model and ONNX conversion

The experimental Laya route downloads its model files separately from the
onnx-community/laya-multilingual-ONNX Hugging Face repository at revision
46b77bbf5642fec5f14e540570228a8cbe8ab81f. The conversion is based on
convaiinnovations/laya-multilingual at revision
1720e3e3357cfe1e281542e223f8273b0890ca34. The pinned model cards identify
Apache-2.0 terms. Model assets are not bundled in this package.

The package adapts the model's documented Choice, Score, and Noul tensor
protocol. Its action head is exposed only as diagnostic data and is not used
for abstention. See the upstream model card and support record for model
quality limitations and source attribution.
